# Threshold simulation {{FIX_ID}} — COMPUTED ESTIMATES (spec only)

- Assumed rule: each logged score is treated as P(AI-like); a text counts as
  detected iff score >= T. The provider's real thresholds are unknown, so at
  no T does this rule reproduce the observed verdicts exactly.
- Probe source: frozen per-detector scores in {{STORE}}/raw + {{STORE}}/records
  (variant scores) and {{ORIGINALS_STORE}}/records ({{ORIGINALS_N}} human
  originals for the FPR column).
- Score-snapshot sha256: {{SNAPSHOT_SHA}} over the sorted
  (variant_id, detector, orig_score, var_score) list.
- Grid: T = 0.05..0.95 step 0.05 (method constant; full curve reported, no
  operating point pre-selected). flips(T) counts passing variants with
  orig_score >= T and var_score < T; FPR(T) counts human originals with
  score >= T.
- Human-FPR bound (absolute): {{FPR_BOUND}}. Curve fact (not a
  recommendation): {{BEST_FACT}}.

